Icon.png/20px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lightning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Lightning\" title=\"Lightning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-lightning\">Lightning</span></a> to attackers if they are in the Static Discharge Aura.</dd></dl></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Static_Discharge:_Electroshock\">Condition: Static Discharge: Electroshock</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Static_Discharge:_Electroshock_(Condition)\" title=\"Static Discharge: Electroshock (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Static_Discharge_Electroshock_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Static_Discharge_Electroshock_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Static_Discharge_Electroshock_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Static_Discharge_Electroshock_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Static_Discharge_Electroshock_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Static_Discharge_Electroshock_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Static Discharge: Electroshock\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Static_Discharge_Electroshock_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Static_Discharge_Electroshock_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Static_Discharge_Electroshock_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\