3wiki-damage-type-lightning\">2d8</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lightning\" title=\"Lightning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lightning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Lightning\" title=\"Lightning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-lightning\">Lightning</span></a> if it attacks Bernard.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Static_Discharge:_Supercharge\">Condition: Static Discharge: Supercharge</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Static_Discharge:_Supercharge_(Condition)\" title=\"Static Discharge: Supercharge (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Static_Discharge_Supercharge_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Static_Discharge_Supercharge_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Static_Discharge_Supercharge_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Static_Discharge_Supercharge_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Static_Discharge_Supercharge_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Static_Discharge_Supercharge_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Static Discharge: Supercharge\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Static_Discharge_Supercharge_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Static_Discharge_